       </h5>\n        </a>\n        <a\n            href=\"https://lqrs.com/brands/carlsberg/?utm_source=q&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=brand&amp;utm_term=Carlsberg\"\n            className=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 bg-white border border-2 border-gray-200 hover600 rounded-2xl group transition-colors min-h-[120px] transition-all duration-300\"\n        >\n            <div className=\"mb-2 w-32 aspect-square flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <img className=\"max-w-full max-h-full object-contain\" src=\"https://lqrs.com/site/assets/files/15605/carlsberg-logo.320x0.png\" alt=\"Carlsberg logo\" />\n            </div>\n            <h5 className=\"text-center text-lg sm font-medium text-gray-900 group-hover600\">\n                Carlsberg\n            </h5>\n        </a>\n        <a\n            href=\"https://lqrs.com/brands/stella-artois/?utm_source=q&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=brand&amp;utm_term=Stella Artois\"\n            className=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 bg-white border border-2 border-gray-200 hover600 rounded-2xl group transition-colors min-h-[120px] transition-all duration-300\"\n        >\n            <div className=\"mb-2 w-32 aspect-square flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <img className=\"max-w-full max-h-full object-contain\" src=\"https://lqrs.com/site/assets/files/62394/stella-artois-logo.320x0.png\" alt=\"Stella Artois logo\" />\n            </div>\n            <h5 className=\"text-center text-lg sm font-medium text-gray-900 group-hover600\">\n                Stella Artois\n            </h5>\n        </a>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
